{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_2026_08_27_vapi_third_voice_provider", "label": "Vapi as a third voice provider research doc", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-27-vapi-third-voice-provider.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_27_vapi_third_voice_provider_path_a_daily_shim", "label": "Path A: @vapi-ai/react-native on a shimmed Daily/LiveKit alias", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-27-vapi-third-voice-provider.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Works on device once Daily's vendored WebRTC fork is deleted and aliased to LiveKit's (react-native-daily-js's podspec doesn't depend on the webrtc pod itself), but rests on an unsupported cross-vendor alias and four stubbed native methods, so it is a spike result, not a supportable dependency."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_27_vapi_third_voice_provider_path_b_websocket_transport", "label": "Path B: Vapi WebSocket transport with a native PCM module", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-27-vapi-third-voice-provider.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bypasses Daily and WebRTC entirely so the prompt and word list never touch the client; costs a native 16kHz PCM capture/playback module with voice-processing AEC that does not exist yet."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_27_vapi_third_voice_provider_webrtc_fork_conflict", "label": "Two WebRTC forks conflict (LiveKit vs Daily) at pod install", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-27-vapi-third-voice-provider.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both @livekit/react-native-webrtc and @daily-co/react-native-webrtc vendor a framework named WebRTC.xcframework; CocoaPods refuses